meta {
  name: List all outreaches
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forms/outreaches?page=&limit=&orderBy=&search=&sortBy=
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 
  limit: 
  orderBy: 
  search: 
  sortBy: 
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List All Outreach Tracker Records
  
  Returns a paginated list of outreach tracker records. Results can be sorted by various fields. Supports full-text search via PostgreSQL GIN index.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Default     | Description / Allowed Values                                                                                          |
  |-----------|--------|----------|-------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | page      | number | No       | `1`         | Page number (integer ≥ 1)                                                                                             |
  | limit     | number | No       | `25`        | Items per page (integer, 1–100)                                                                                       |
  | orderBy   | string | No       | `desc`      | Sort direction. One of: `asc`, `desc`                                                                                 |
  | sortBy    | string | No       | `createdAt` | One of: `outreachStartDate`, `outreachEndDate`, `outreachState`, `outreachType`, `createdAt`                          |
  | search    | string | No       | —           | Full-text search query. When provided, cache and sort filters are bypassed and results are matched against the GIN index. |
  
  ### Searchable Fields
  
  | Field                | Weight |
  |----------------------|--------|
  | `submittedBy`        | A      |
  | `outreachType`       | A      |
  | `outreachState`      | A      |
  | `outreachCommunity`  | A      |
  | `outreachCity`       | B      |
  | `outreachLga`        | B      |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns a paginated array of outreach tracker records.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Outreaches found successfully",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "outreachStartDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
        "outreachEndDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
        "outreachState": "string",
        "outreachLga": "string",
        "outreachCity": "string",
        "outreachCommunity": "string",
        "numVolunteers": 10,
        "numBeneficiaries": 50,
        "outreachType": ["string"],
        "activityDescription": "string",
        "impactStories": "string" | null,
        "challengesEncountered": "string" | null,
        "recommendations": "string" | null,
        "submittedBy": "string",
        "submissionDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
        "updatedAt": "ISO 8601" | null,
        "createdAt": "ISO 8601",
        "deletedAt": "ISO 8601" | null
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 25,
        "totalPages": 1
      },
      "metadata": {
        "communitiesEngaged": 5,
        "beneficiariesReached": 100,
        "volunteers": 10,
        "outreachEvents": 15
      }
    }
  }
  ```
  
  Results are cached under the key `cedarrise:outreaches:{page}:{limit}:{orderBy}:{sortBy}` using the `FORM_DATA` TTL.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                           |
  |-----------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid query parameters (e.g. unknown `sortBy` key). |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.              |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | Authenticated user lacks `read` permission.           |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                              |
}
